# The Equal Lens brand package comes from GitHub Packages (SWED-109), which needs a token even to install:
# a classic token with read:packages, exported as NPM_TOKEN locally (export NPM_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) once gh has
# the read:packages scope) and set as a project environment variable on Vercel.
@priyanshuj0410-code:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
